  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 602.07 Coastal functional assessment (CFA)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 602.07 “Coastal functional assessment (CFA)” means an evaluation of the jurisdictional coastal natural resource areas that would be impacted by a proposed project, and recommendations to protect the areas during and as a result of the project.\n\nSource. #12806, eff 12-15-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt600.html"
